{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Comment vous appelez-vous ?"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": " A, B, C..."}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "Beginner"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "L'alphabet"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "En fran\u00e7ais, l'alphabet comprend 26 lettres. On emploie ces lettres pour repr\u00e9senter les 37 sons fran\u00e7ais : 16 voyelles, 18 consonnes et 3 semi-consonnes.</br> Le tableau suivant montre les 26 lettres de l'alphabet et la mani\u00e8re de les prononcer lorsqu'on \u00e9p\u00e8le un mot."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">L'Alphabet</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a (a)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"j (ji)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"s (\u00e8s)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"b (b\u00e9)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"k (ka)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"t (t\u00e9)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"c (s\u00e9)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"l (\u00e8l)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"u (u)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"d (d\u00e9)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"m (\u00e8m)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"v (v\u00e9)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"e (eu)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"n (\u00e8n)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"w (double v\u00e9)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"f (\u00e8f)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"o (o)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"x (iks)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"g (j\u00e9)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"p (p\u00e9)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"y (i grec)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"h (ach)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"q (ku)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"z (zed)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"i (i)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"r (\u00e8r)\\\"}\",\"\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "On emploie les lettres <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>a</span></span></u>, <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>e</span></span></u>, <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>i</span></span></u>, <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>o</span></span></u> et <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>u</span></span></u> et leurs combinaisons avec d'autres lettres pour repr\u00e9senter les 16 voyelles -- [a], [\u0251], [\u0251\u0303], [i], [y], [u], [e], [\u00f8], [o], [\u025b], [\u025b\u0303], [\u0259], [\u0153], [\u0153\u0303], [\u1d10] et [\u1d10\u0303] -- et les 3 semi-consonnes [j], [w] et [\u0265].</br> On emploie les autres lettres de l'alphabet et leurs combinaisons pour repr\u00e9senter les 18 consonnes.</br></br>En fran\u00e7ais il y a aussi cinq signes diacritiques qu'on emploie pour repr\u00e9senter des sons :</br> - l'accent aigu : \u00e9</br>- l'accent grave : \u00e0, \u00e8, \u00f9</br>- l'accent circonflexe : \u00e2, \u00ea, \u00ee, \u00f4, \u00fb</br>- le tr\u00e9ma : \u00ef </br>- la c\u00e9dille : \u00e7</br>\u00c0 l'exception de la c\u00e9dille, tous les autres signes diacritiques accompagnent les lettres <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>a</span></span></u>, <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>e</span></span></u>, <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>i</span></span></u>, <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>o</span></span></u> et <span class = \"strong\"><span class = \"italic\"><u>u</span></span></u>."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Les moments de la journ\u00e9e et les repas correspondants"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Il est <span class = \"strong\">matin</span> en Colombie. Vanessa prend son <span class = \"strong\">petit-d\u00e9jeuner</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Anne <span class = \"strong\">d\u00e9jeune</span> dans un bistrot \u00e0 <span class = \"strong\">midi</span> ou t\u00f4t dans <span class = \"strong\">l'apr\u00e8s-midi</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Moments de la journ\u00e9e\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Repas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verbes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le matin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le petit-d\u00e9jeuner\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le midi et l'apr\u00e8s-midi\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le d\u00e9jeuner\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"d\u00e9jeuner\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"l'apr\u00e8s-midi\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le go\u00fbter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go\u00fbter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le soir\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le d\u00eener\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"d\u00eener\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Le <span class = \"strong\">go\u00fbter</span> est un repas l\u00e9ger qu'on prend vers quatre heures de <span class = \"strong\">l'apr\u00e8s-midi</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"product-color-text\">Notes</span></span></br>- Au Qu\u00e9bec et dans le sud de la France, on appelle le repas du soir <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">le souper</span></span> et non <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">le d\u00eener</span></span>. Le verbe  correspondant est <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">souper</span></span>.</br>- On emploie le verbe <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">prendre</span></span> avec tous les noms des repas quand on n'utilise pas les verbes <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">d\u00e9jeuner</span></span>, <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">d\u00eener</span></span>, <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">go\u00fbter</span></span> et <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">souper</span></span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Ce <span class = \"strong\">soir</span> Kenji pr\u00e9pare son <span class = \"strong\">d\u00eener</span> chez soi."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Marie et Jeanne <span class = \"strong\">soupent</span> ensemble tous les soirs."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Les mots suivants commencent avec les lettres A, B, C, D et E."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Anne"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "un pr\u00e9nom f\u00e9minin usuel en fran\u00e7ais"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(nom f.)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : Anne se pr\u00e9sente \u00e0 Kenji et Vanessa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "la baguette"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "une sorte de pain typiquement fran\u00e7ais"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(nom f.)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : J'ach\u00e8te une baguette \u00e0 la boulangerie."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "le beurre"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "un aliment laitier qu'on emploie pour faire des tartines"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(nom m.)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : Je mange des tartines au beurre et \u00e0 la confiture."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "boire"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "ing\u00e9rer un liquide"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verbe)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : Je bois du th\u00e9."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "le caf\u00e9"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "une boisson obtenue \u00e0 partir des graines du caf\u00e9ier "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(nom m.)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : Vanessa aime le caf\u00e9."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "la confiture"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "une pr\u00e9paration \u00e0 base de fruits et de sucre"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(nom f.)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Exemple : Vous aimez la confiture d'oranges."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "la Colombie"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "un pays de l'Am\u00e9rique du Sud"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(nom f.)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : Vanessa habite en Colombie."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "L'apprenant utilise une information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire et pr\u00e9cise dans des situations simples."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "L'apprenant fournit de l'information personnelle simple \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral dans des phrases simples et compr\u00e9hensibles."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "L'apprenant fournit de l'information personnelle simple \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral dans des phrases simples et compr\u00e9hensibles."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "L'apprenant fournit de l'information personnelle simple \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral dans des phrases simples et compr\u00e9hensibles."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "frn1le01ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "d\u00e9jeuner"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "manger \u00e0 midi ; prendre le d\u00e9jeuner"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verbe)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : Nous d\u00e9jeunons dans un bistrot."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "d\u00eener"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "manger le soir"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verbe)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : Kenji d\u00eene chez lui."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "l'\u00e9tudiant, l'\u00e9tudiante"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "un apprenant ou une apprenante \u00e0 l'universit\u00e9"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(nom m./f.)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Exemple : Jeanne et Pierre sont des \u00e9tudiants en fran\u00e7ais."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "frn1le01ob04aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Avec un coll\u00e8gue, prononcez les virelangues ci-dessous \u00e0 voix haute. Est-ce qu'ils sont similaires ?</br></br> Didier d\u00eene dit-on de dix dos dodus de dindon ! </br>Douze douches douces !</br>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Encerclez tous les mots qui commencent avec une voyelle. </br></br> <span class=\"italic\">Salut, Kenji et Vanessa. Je m'appelle Anne et je suis de France. Nous sommes des \u00e9tudiants en fran\u00e7ais. C'est l'apr\u00e8s-midi ici. Je d\u00e9jeune dans un bistrot. Je prends une salade et des p\u00e2tes avec de la baguette. Je bois du jus d'orange. Au revoir, Kenji et Vanessa. \u00c0 la prochaine.</span></br><br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maintenant, lisez les phrases \u00e0 voix haute."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Je reconnais des consonnes et des voyelles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Je prononce correctement les mots-cl\u00e9s dans des phrases."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Je prononce les moments de la journ\u00e9e."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "id": 0, "text": "", "image": "frn1le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "0", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kenji</span> : Salut. Je m'appelle Kenji et je suis du Japon. C'est le soir ici. Je d\u00eene chez moi. Je mange du riz, de la soupe et des sushis. Je bois du th\u00e9 vert.</br>", "image": "frn1le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "12500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : Salut, Kenji. Je m'appelle Vanessa et je suis de Colombie. Ce n'est pas le soir ici. C'est le matin. Je prends mon petit-d\u00e9jeuner. Je mange des tartines au beurre et \u00e0 la confiture. Je bois du lait. J'aime aussi le caf\u00e9.</br>", "image": "frn1le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "32000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Anne</span> : Salut, Kenji et Vanessa. Je m'appelle Anne et je suis de France. Nous sommes des \u00e9tudiants en fran\u00e7ais. C'est l'apr\u00e8s-midi ici. Je d\u00e9jeune dans un bistrot. Je prends une salade et des p\u00e2tes avec de la baguette. Je bois du jus d'orange. Au revoir, Kenji et Vanessa. \u00c0 la prochaine.", "image": "frn1le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn1le01ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn1le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": "", "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "exercises": [{"type": "WLC", "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "Je peux prononcer et employer les lettres <span class=\"italic\">A</span>, <span class=\"italic\">B</span>, <span class=\"italic\">C</span>, <span class=\"italic\">D</span> et <span class=\"italic\">E</span>."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "Je peux dire des phrases simples."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "Je peux comprendre un bref enregistrement audio."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Pouvez-vous dire : \"Didier d\u00eene dit-on de dix dos dodus de dindon\" ?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "C'est difficile \u00e0 dire ? C'est un virelangue !"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Coin prononciation : <span class=\"italic\">A</span>, <span class=\"italic\">B</span>, <span class=\"italic\">C</span>... Entra\u00eenons-nous \u00e0 parler !"}], "id": 0, "img_path": "", "template_override": 1}, {"type": "STI", "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "correct": 0}, {"selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "correct": 1}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\u00c9coutez Kenji, Vanessa et Anne se pr\u00e9senter les uns aux autres !"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Vous avez deux essais."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Il vous reste un essai."}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Essayez encore une fois !"}, {"type": "text", "content": "La prochaine fois peut-\u00eatre."}], "correct_feedback": "Parfait !", "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"value": "{\"type\": \"skill\", \"content\": \"Listening\"}", "valid": 1, "type": "skill", "conten